# FAQ Optimization and Redesign

The user reported performance issues (lag) in the FAQ accordion and requested a visual update to the "immersion" neumorphic style used across the site.

## Proposed Changes

### [UI Components]
#### [MODIFY] [accordion.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/accordion.tsx)
- Review animation logic. If it's using heavy CSS transitions or multiple layout triggers, optimize them.

### [FAQ Components]
#### [MODIFY] [FAQ.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/contact/FAQ.tsx)
- Apply persistent **inset** shadows to accordion items.
- Remove background hover transitions that might cause recalculations.
- Enhance typography legibility.

#### [MODIFY] [DetailedFAQ.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/faq/DetailedFAQ.tsx)
- Apply the same immersion style consistently.
- Ensure efficient rendering of multiple items.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure no UI breakages.

### Manual Verification
- Test accordion responsiveness in the browser.
- Verify the "inset" look matches other sections.
